Description: link ColumnListView through libbe, no libcolumnlistview.so
 On V\OS ColumnListView and ColumnTypes are compiled into libbe
 (src/kits/interface/ColumnListView.cpp) and no libcolumnlistview.so is
 shipped anywhere, so the link dies with "cannot find -lcolumnlistview".
 Dropping the entry keeps the classes resolving through the libbe that is
 already linked.
Author: Numerio <b.vitruvio@gmail.com>
Forwarded: no
Origin: https://github.com/HaikuArchives/ffmpegGUI

--- a/Makefile
+++ b/Makefile
@@ -67,7 +67,7 @@
 #		you need to specify the path to the library and it's name.
 #		(e.g. for mylib.a, specify "mylib.a" or "path/mylib.a")
 
-LIBS = be tracker localestub columnlistview translation $(STDCPPLIBS)
+LIBS = be tracker localestub translation $(STDCPPLIBS)
 
 #	Specify additional paths to directories following the standard libXXX.so
 #	or libXXX.a naming scheme. You can specify full paths or paths relative
